     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi</div><div> </div><div><span>First of all</span> <span>thank you</span> <span>for this fantastic</span> <span>example of using</span> <span>shiny (<a href=\"http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/superzip-example.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/superzip-example.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792402739935000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0u1ESzUf6OJSWGUeBMmJih\">http://shiny.rstudio.com/gallery/superzip-example.html</a>)</span></div><div><span></span> <br><span>I try to</span> <span>reproduce</span> <span>the behavior of the</span> <span>Data</span> <span>explorer</span> <span>clicking </span><span>the</span> <span>Action</span> <span>button on each</span> <span>row of the table to generate a action based on the record</span><span>;</span> <span>I copied the</span> <span>js</span> <span>code</span> <span>to capture</span> <span>information in a row</span> <span>from another table </span></div><div><span></span> </div><div><span></span><span></span> </div><div><span><em><font color=\"#ff0000\">$(document).on(&quot;click&quot;, &quot;.go-map2&quot;, function(e) {<br>  e.preventDefault();<br>  $el = $(this);<br>  var RiskN = $el.data(&quot;RiskN&quot;);<br>  alert(&quot;RiskN : &quot; + RiskN);<br>   Shiny.onInputChange(&quot;gotoR&quot;, {<br>    RiskN: RiskN,<br>    nonce: Math.random()<br>  });<br>});<br></font></em></span></div><div><span>I also</span> <span>adapted the</span> <span>code</span> <span>server.r</span> <span>creating</span>  <span>another <span>Observe </span>function</span></div><div><span></span> </div><div><span><em><font color=\"#ff0000\">observe({<br>    if (is.null(input$gotoR))<br>      return()<br>    isolate({<br>      <br>      RiskN &lt;- input$gotoR$RiskN<br>       print (input$gotoR)<br>   print(paste (&quot;Risque n : &quot;,RiskN))<br>    })<br>  })<br></font></em> </span></div><div><span>and of course</span> <span>another</span> <span>function</span> <span>renderdatatable</span> <br></div><div><font color=\"#ff0000\"><em>output$RRTable = renderDataTable({<br></em> <br> dataT %.% filter(Ranking&gt;0) %.% mutate(Action = paste(&#39;&lt;a class=&quot;go-map2&quot; href=&quot;&quot; data-RiskN=&quot;&#39;, RiskNr, &#39;&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa fa-crosshairs&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#39;, sep=&quot;&quot;))<br><br>  }<br> <br> )</font></div><div><br><span>Fields (and first record)</span> <span>of my</span> <span>table</span> <span>are (after mutate)</span></div><div> </div><div><table style=\"width:827px;height:195px;border-collapse:collapse\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"827\">\r\n\r\n <colgroup><col style=\"width:98pt\" width=\"131\">\r\n <col style=\"width:447pt\" width=\"596\">\r\n <tbody><tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0.5pt;border-style:solid dotted dotted solid;border-color:windowtext;width:98pt;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\" width=\"131\">ValuationPeriod</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0.5pt 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:solid solid dotted none;border-color:windowtext windowtext windowtext black;width:447pt;background-color:transparent\" width=\"596\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">YE2011</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none dotted dotted solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\">RiskNr</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid dotted none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">124-001</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none dotted dotted solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\">Risikobezeichnung</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid dotted none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">Risk1</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none dotted dotted solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\">RiskProba</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid dotted none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\" align=\"right\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">0,02</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none dotted dotted solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\">RiskQuant</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid dotted none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\" align=\"right\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">1000,00</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none dotted dotted solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\">R</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid dotted none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\" align=\"right\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">2000,00</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none dotted dotted solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\">Ranking</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid dotted none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\" align=\"right\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">1</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none dotted dotted solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\">Color</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid dotted none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">orange</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr style=\"height:14.25pt\" height=\"19\">\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt;border-style:none dotted solid solid;border-color:black windowtext windowtext;height:14.25pt;background-color:transparent\" height=\"19\">Action</td>\r\n  <td style=\"border-width:0px 0.5pt 0.5pt 0px;border-style:none solid solid none;border-color:black windowtext windowtext black;background-color:transparent\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\">&lt;a\r\n  class=&quot;go-map2&quot; href=&quot;&quot;\r\n  data-RiskN=&quot;124-001&quot;&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;fa\r\n  fa-crosshairs&quot;&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/a&gt;</font></td>\r\n </tr>\r\n\r\n</tbody></colgroup></table></div><div> </div><div><br><span>The</span> <span>js</span> <span>code</span> <span>returns</span> <span> always </span><span>:</span> <span>&quot;<strong>undefined</strong>&quot; (<span>fails</span> <span>to read the</span> <span>table field <strong>RiskNr</strong>)</span></span></div><div><span></span> </div><div><span></span> </div><div><span></span> </div><div><span>Thanks for help</span></div><div><span></span> </div><div><span>Alain</span></div><div><span></span> </div><div><span></span> </div></div>"
    ]
